 "best_idea": "A hit check that compares two uniform rolls (attack against evasion), with a 1,000,000 sentinel for certain outcomes, gives a closed-form hit chance a designer can tune from two numbers.",
 "decision": "adapt",
 "decision_why": "The two-roll hit compare with a sentinel for certain outcomes is a clean, tunable hit check for duels, but the donor rolls on the client, makes parry an open-ended stat and applies armour after every multiplier, so Frankendom must roll on the server, keep parry under the guard row and test the armour order.",
 "decision_status": "proposed",
 "acceptance": "A server test with accuracy equal to evasion gives a hit rate of 50 percent over 10,000 seeded swings (within 1 percent); accuracy twice evasion gives 75 percent; a defender with an active parry is never hit; the same seed gives the same result on both clients."
